new

domain extent -10.0 10.0

; generate balls
set random 10001 ; set the seed of the random number generator to ensure repeatability

ball generate ...
     group ballgroup2_1 ...
     radius 1.0 1.0 ...
     box -6.0  -1.0 -5.0 5.0 ...
     cubic ...
     id 1 100 ...
     tries 100000

ball generate ...
     group ballgroup2_2 ...
     radius 1.0 1.0 ...
     box 1.0  6.0 -5.0 5.0 ...
     hexagonal ...
     number 500 ...
     tries 1000

;关键词cubic和hexagonal均不能与关键词gauss共存
;采用关键词cubic或hexagonal后，关键词id、num和tries均不再起作用，生成颗粒个数自动计算


cmat default model linear property kn 1e6 proximity 0.0

clean